msgstr "  Takav Timeline još nije postojao -- samo se gradi."

msgid "  Note: this computes with the files uploaded at the time. They carry\n  the time window and the alignment of that day. Where the In point, the Out point\n  or the measured position differ now, the return check measures the\n  difference and moves the tracks into place."
msgstr "  Napomena: računa se s datotekama prenesenima tada. One nose\n  vremenski prozor i poravnanje toga dana. Gdje se točka In, točka Out\n  ili izmjereni položaj sada razlikuju, povratna provjera mjeri\n  razliku i pomiče zapise na mjesto."

msgid "  Note: this ffmpeg has no soxr -- clock drift can only be taken out in\n  steps of 21 ppm."
msgstr "  Napomena: ovaj ffmpeg nema soxr -- drift sata može se ukloniti samo\n  u koracima od 21 ppm."

